| **Ramps** | ✅ Main entrance & service entrance (guest‑use) | ✅ Main entrance & throughout the property |
| **Accessible restaurant** | ✅ Wheel‑chair‑friendly tables, lowered counters, step‑free entry | ✅ Same plus adjustable‑height seating |
